%U A011947 33554175,67108863,134217693,268434943,536870911,1073741823,2147482610,4294967229,8589934591
%N A011947 Number of Barlow packings with group P63/mmc(O) that repeat after 4n+2 layers.
%C A011947 Also, the nonzero bisection of Moebius transform of A082392.
%H A011947 T. J. McLarnan, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1524/zkri.1981.155.3-4.269">The numbers of polytypes in close-packings and related structures</a>, Zeits. Krist. 155, 269-291 (1981).
%F A011947 (n+1) = 2^n-A383182(n). - _M. F. Hasler_, May 03 2008; sequence number corrected by _M. F. Hasler_, May 27 2025
%o A011947 (PARI) A129629_upto(N=100)={ my( d=2*N+3, b=Vec( sum( k=0, exponent(d), (x^2^k)/(1-2*x^2^(k+1)), O(x^d)))); vector( N, i, sumdiv(i*2-1, k, moebius((i*2-1)/k)*b[k])) } \\  _M. F. Hasler_, May 03 2008, updated May 27 2025
%K A011947 nonn,easy
